{# Which of Home's feeds is showing, for someone signed in, where the
   feed's heading would be: Recent (/), every public drawing as it arrives;
   Following (/following), the people they follow; and Communities
   (/joined), the communities they are a member of. Signed out there is
   only Recent, and home.jinja gives it its heading instead. Orders of
   one feed rather than places, so a switch on the feed rather than tabs
   in the toolbar -- which marks Home on all of them (oeeeMarkCurrent,
   toolbar.jinja). Links, so each is still its own address to go back to
   and to share. `feed_switch` is the one showing (handlers/home.rs). #}
{% set feeds = [("recent", "/"), ("following", "/following"), ("communities", "/joined")] %}
{% import "pill_macro.jinja" as pill %}
<nav class="ds-segmented feed-switch" aria-label="{{ ftl_get_message("feed-switch") }}" {{ pill.in_place() }}>
  {% for name, path in feeds %}
    <a href="{{ path|safe }}"{% if feed_switch == name %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ ftl_get_message("feed-" ~ name) }}</a>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>
